    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make ramen on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ramen orders, make the ramen quickly and correctly, then serve it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRules\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and serve as much ramen as you can before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour the soup, boil the noodles, then add the right toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to the firmness of the noodles and fill each order correctly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Check the order - Memorize the ramen type and noodle firmness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Add the soup - Be careful not to mess up the flavor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Boil the noodles - Once the firmness is just right, drain the water!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add the toppings - Follow the recipe for each ramen type!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Serve it up - Get the order correct for the most points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from all over the world for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your ramen-making skills!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make ramen on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ramen orders, make the ramen quickly and correctly, then serve it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRules\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and serve as much ramen as you can before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour the soup, boil the noodles, then add the right toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to the firmness of the noodles and fill each order correctly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Check the order - Memorize the ramen type and noodle firmness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Add the soup - Be careful not to mess up the flavor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Boil the noodles - Once the firmness is just right, drain the water!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add the toppings - Follow the recipe for each ramen type!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Serve it up - Get the order correct for the most points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from all over the world for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your ramen-making skills!</p>",
